						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TO POLAR\n\nThe To Polar node converts a cartesian coordinate into a polar coordinate.\nThe node takes a float2(X,Y) and returns a radius and azimuth to be used in a polar system.\nBecause Wire is cartesian based, you will probably get more mileage out of this node's bigger brother: From Polar."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
					"height": 331.8343505859375,
					"width": 821.935546875,
					"x": 1265.2337646484375,
					"y": -526.3575439453125
				},
				"class": {
